{
  "slug": "hig-compliance-auditor",
  "name": "Hig Compliance Auditor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Audits codebases and design systems against Apple's Human Interface Guidelines. Scans SwiftUI, UIKit, CSS, HTML, and JavaScript for HIG violations across iOS, iPadOS, macOS, watchOS, tvOS, visionOS, and Web/PWA targets. Generates structured compliance reports with severity tiers (Critical, High, Medium, Low), platform-specific guidance, accessibility audit results, and actionable remediation options. Applies fixes on user approval with inline attribution comments referencing the specific HIG guideline violated. Covers typography and Dynamic Type, semantic color systems, Dark Mode architecture, Liquid Glass material usage, layout and safe areas, touch target sizing, SF Symbols compliance, App Store Review Guidelines 2025/2026, and AI transparency requirements.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `hig-compliance-auditor` (Audits codebases and design systems against Apple's Human Interface Guidelines (HIG), generates detailed compliance reports, and applies fixes…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hig-compliance-auditor@claude-community` from `omrajguru05/hig-compliance-auditor`.",
